# Investor Badge

`EtProInvestorBadge` and `EtPopularInvestorBadge` are the new investor status badges for Pro Investors and Popular Investors.

They replace the old colored-star indicators. Use these components when showing the user's investor status in profile, social, discovery, or people-related surfaces.

## Usage

```tsx
import { EtPopularInvestorBadge, EtProInvestorBadge } from 'etoro-ui';

<EtProInvestorBadge />
<EtPopularInvestorBadge />
<EtPopularInvestorBadge showLabel={false} iconSize={24} />
```

## Contract

- `EtProInvestorBadge` always renders the Pro investor crown icon and `"Pro"` label in `#F1C056`.
- `EtPopularInvestorBadge` always renders the Popular Investor crown icon and `"Popular"` label in `#9EB1DD`.
- `showLabel` defaults to `true`. Set `showLabel={false}` for icon-only placements, for example inside `EtAvatar` badge slots.
- `iconSize` is a pixel value and defaults to `18`.
- The badges are non-interactive text markers. Do not wrap them in `Pressable`; place a separate button or link nearby if an action is needed.
- The labels are fixed and not translated. These are brand/status marks, not user-provided copy.
- Use the exported components for badges. Use the raw `pro-investor` and `popular-investor` icons only when an icon-only design explicitly calls for them.

## File Map

- `et-investor-badge.tsx` — JSX composition and public component exports.
- `types.ts` — public props and internal variant/config contracts.
- `styles.ts` — shared layout and text style constants.
- `utils.ts` — fixed Pro/Popular config, icon size, colors, and label mapping.
